# Placeholder for the agent gateway API key file (Docker secret).
#
# The real secrets/agent-gateway.key is git-ignored and generated by
# scripts/bootstrap-secrets.sh with: openssl rand -hex 32
# It must contain a single line of at least 32 characters.
# compose/ai-node.yml mounts it at /run/secrets/agent_gateway_key; app.py
# reads it via AGENT_GATEWAY_KEY_FILE and falls back to the AGENT_GATEWAY_KEY
# env var (secrets/agent-gateway.env) when the file is unset.
replace-with-openssl-rand-hex-32-output
